## M48.6d: the Arcade dock's and the packs' art (PLAN 0.9.2): the owner-approved pixel mockup's
## kits as data, grid for grid: the guns (56x34 splash art and 20x14 icons, one shared ramp, with
## the mockup page's grip pass on the pistol and the laser so they read on the dark art window),
## the booster pack (the common foil: whole, tearing, open, peeking, the dock's small one; the
## badge, the gauge, the card back with the logo, the small flying card), the frames kit's
## builders run once (the four card frames with their shimmer phases, the hand slots, the fuse
## link) and the fx sheets the reveals use (sparks, the ring, confetti, foil shards, smoke, the
## rip word, lightning, the FUSED stamp, the dither flash). No rays, no halo, no card banner.
##
## GENERATED from .check/mockups/ui_v4/pixel_art/*.js by a throwaway node script that ran the
## kits themselves, so no grid was retyped. One char per art pixel, "." clear. Data only: the
## painting is ArcadePaint's. Drawn in code, no image file. Presentation only.

